# Requests against a locally started notification service (README, quick start).
# Create an order first with order-service/requests.http; its notifications arrive within a moment.

@host = http://localhost:8081
@orderId = 1
@notificationId = 1

### Notifications stored for an order
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications?orderId={{orderId}}

### One notification by id (use an id from the list above)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}

### An invalid order id - 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/notifications?orderId=0

### The OpenAPI document (Swagger UI: {{host}}/swagger-ui.html)
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
